@startuml
!include /Volumes/SSD/Dev/active/PRM392_FlutterMobile/diagrams-agent/style.iuml
skinparam linestyle ortho

rectangle "view : WorkspaceViewModel" as V
rectangle "repo : ReviewRepository" as R
rectangle "api : ReviewApi" as A
rectangle "proxy : FastAPI" as P
rectangle "cache : ReviewCache" as C
rectangle "limiter : RateLimiter" as L
rectangle "provider : GeminiProvider" as G
rectangle "verify : QuoteVerifier" as Q
rectangle "store : SessionStore" as S

V -right-> R : 1: run(selected)
R -right-> A : 1.1: review(unit)
A -right-> P : 1.1.1: POST /review
P -right-> C : 1.1.2: lookup(key)
C ..> P : 1.1.3: hit
C ..> L : 1.1.4: miss
L -right-> G : 1.1.5: allowed
G ..> Q : 1.1.6: JSON có quote
Q ..> P : 1.1.7: giữ quote hợp lệ
P ..> C : 1.1.8: put
C ..> A : 1.1.9: ReviewResult
A ..> R : 1.2: result
R ..> V : 1.3: progress/result
V -right-> S : 2: saveSnapshot

note bottom of P
  Communication diagram (emulated).
  Cache hit trả về trước RateLimiter; miss mới tính quota.
end note
@enduml
